{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37163","headline":"题玉芝双奉院 · 顾在熔","name":"题玉芝双奉院","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"入门如洞府，花木与时稀。\n夜坐山当户，秋吟叶满衣。\n犬随童子出，鸟避俗人飞。\n至药应将熟，年年火气微。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾在熔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37163.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37163","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}